Cell["\<\
Finally we check that for cases where we have two NS-sector vacua, PF with \
(g,h) and (g,hz) are equal.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987203336793013*^9, 
  3.987203405912653*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1308e566-7f21-4206-8c4e-\
